    "extract": "Márton Rátkai was a Hungarian actor and comedian. In 1917 he starred with Dezső Gyárfás in the comedy Harrison and Barrison, one of the most popular and best-known Hungarian films of the silent era. He was awarded the Kossuth Prize in 1949.",
    "extract_html": "<p><b>Márton Rátkai</b> was a Hungarian actor and comedian. In 1917 he starred with Dezső Gyárfás in the comedy <i>Harrison and Barrison</i>, one of the most popular and best-known Hungarian films of the silent era. He was awarded the Kossuth Prize in 1949.</p>"
